      "description": "Read, regenerate or extend the UML class diagrams of a harness: one per harness and one per named sub-graph it declares, plus the harness object model. Every box is generated from a declaration and a schema, never drawn by hand, so a wrong diagram is fixed at the declaration or the schema, and a dashed \"could not determine\" box is a finding about the registry.",
